SUMMARY:Inprint BCM HEAL Book Club discusses The People's Hospital
DTSTAMP:20260730T054953Z
DTSTART:20261013T183000Z
DESCRIPTION:This Inprint BCM HEAL Book Club meeting will take place via Zoo
	m. The Zoom link will be the same for every meeting and will be provided i
	n your Eventbrite email receipt (scroll down to the Additional Information
	 section). \n  \n \nOn October 13\, 2026 the Inprint BCM HEAL Book Club wi
	ll discuss The People’s Hospital: Hope and Peril in American Medicine by R
	icardo Nuila. \nInprint BCM HEAL Book Club meetings are free and designed 
	for those involved in the healthcare community. Meetings are facilitated b
	y Stacy Nigliazzo. The full schedule of Inprint BCM HEAL Book Club meeting
	s for 2026 appears on the main Inprint BCM HEAL Book Club webpage\, which 
	you can access by\, clicking here. \nIf you have any further questions\, p
	lease email info@inprint.org. \n\n\nhttps://inprinthouston.org/event/inpri
	nt-bcm-heal-book-club-discusses-the-peoples-hospital/\n\nFrom Inprint Hous
	ton
